{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Taylor Base Unit Tests\n\nUnit tests for the base Taylor module:\n- Holomorphic and antiholomorphic Taylor expansion\n- Combined Taylor expansion consistency\n- Linearity and scalar extraction\n- Private helper utilities (partition and field counting)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Remove[\"Global`*\"]\nNeeds[\"StringCode`\"]\nStringCode`InitStringCode[<|\"theory\" -> \"Bosonic\", \"CFT\" -> \"FlatSpace\", \"conventions\" -> \"Bosonic-Xi\", \"bracket\" -> \"Flat\", \"signature\" -> \"Euclidean\"|>]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1770588893657,
     "endTime": 1770588893840
    },
    "executionOrder": 312,
    "success": true
   }
  },
